        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 1,499 km via NH‑19 usually takes 3‑4 business days, depending on weather and road conditions. All our trucks are equipped with satellite GPS, allowing you to monitor real‑time location through a secure client portal. You’ll also receive daily status updates via SMS or email.</p>
